# Wave W17-O (Comet Falls): comet wall — breached cavern wall: wet grey strata bands, and through them the broken sky-roof’s seams — one pale star-stone seam band running at shoulder height, flecked with fallen-sky sparkle where the roof once opened to the stars (design: the cave the meteor built; the broken sky-roof is drawn in the wall kind’s art, art layer only). Comet Deep’s own wall — split from Scorch’s heat-darkened ember bands by hue (wet grey vs ember-brown) and from every other cave wall by the star seam.
